\* All TLC check configs for AntflyReplayEnrichmentBridge.tla.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyOmitEnrichmentFloor = FALSE
    BuggyAdvanceEmptyScan = FALSE
    BuggyOmitRestartArm = FALSE
    BuggyRetryWithoutBoundary = FALSE
    BuggyDropExhaustedRepairDebt = FALSE
    MaxSeq = 2
    MaxEpoch = 1

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    WatermarksOrdered
    RetainedUntilAllConsumersApplied
    NoAdvancePastCoverageDebt
    CompletedWorkWasDurable
    RetryRequiresSchedulerBoundary
    ExhaustedRetryHasDurableRepairDebt
    Safety

PROPERTIES
    CoverageEventuallyDrains

