==== BadDroppedRepairDebt
\* Retry exhaustion must persist repair debt before terminal coverage.
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyOmitEnrichmentFloor = FALSE
    BuggyAdvanceEmptyScan = FALSE
    BuggyOmitRestartArm = FALSE
    BuggyRetryWithoutBoundary = FALSE
    BuggyDropExhaustedRepairDebt = TRUE
    MaxSeq = 2
    MaxEpoch = 1

INVARIANTS
    ExhaustedRetryHasDurableRepairDebt
